                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have played many a game during my 7 years on this platform, but none come remotely close to surpassing the excellence presented to me in this game: Learn to Fly 3. This piece of media is a true masterpiece, it stands alone in a league it made for itself; a league so far above the others. Someone who hasn't indulged in the feeling of ecstasy this game brings couldn't possibly begin to understand how amazing Learn to Fly 3 really is. I'm not sure why it's called Learn to Fly 3, since there is only one instance of something like it on Steam, but rest assured, if they release Learn to Fly 4, know that I will be there.",
